    },
    "message": "SDK variant removed from ANcpLua.NET.Sdk main (2026-08); this package pins the retired ANcpLua.Agents.Hosting.BitNet 1.4.10-alpha.1 line. Use ANcpLua.NET.Sdk (or ANcpLua.NET.Sdk.Web) plus an explicit PackageReference to ANcpLua.Agents.Hosting.BitNet 5.x.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "ANcpLua SDK for ASP.NET Core projects with one-line BitNet (bitnet.cpp llama-server) hosting. Auto-references ANcpLua.Agents.Hosting.BitNet so a single Sdk attribute plus builder.AddQylBitNetChatClient() wires a keyed IChatClient, health check, and OpenTelemetry. Setup script and BITNET_URL / BITNET_API_PATH / BITNET_MODEL env vars are the runtime prerequisite.",
